  "tagline": "Your Cities: Skylines city rises in Resident Evil 2's sky, and RE2 fights its T-virus outbreak.",
  "description": "Run Resident Evil 2 and Cities: Skylines together. Your city's towers fill RE2's sky above the police station, following RE2's camera. A T-virus outbreak spreads through your districts: police and healthcare slow it, blackouts speed it up, and every zombie you kill in RE2 pushes it back. Mr. X and G cause surges, a rising outbreak makes RE2 harder and greener, and a city blackout darkens RE2. Press F9 in Cities: Skylines to build, with RE2's bodycam in the corner.",
  "method": "passthrough",
  "tier": "unlocked",
  "testLabel": "beta",
  "games": [
